></path></svg></span></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 pl-[3.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:px-6 sm:pb-6 sm:pl-[4.25rem]">It is 100% human hair, wholesale grade. That means the hair is sorted and blended from several donors to keep volume and price steady. It is not single donor hair, and we price it that way.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white transition-colors open:border-pink/40 open:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-28px_rgb(233_30_115/0.45)]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="tabular w-6 shrink-0 text-sm font-extrabold text-pink">02</span><span class="flex-1 font-bold sm:text-lg">Do I have to buy 1 kg?</span><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blush text-pink transition-all duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-pink group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 pl-[3.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:px-6 sm:pb-6 sm:pl-[4.25rem]">No. The minimum is 100g, which is 1 bundle. 100-200g usually ships right away from stock.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white transition-colors open:border-pink/40 open:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-28px_rgb(233_30_115/0.45)]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="tabular w-6 shrink-0 text-sm font-extrabold text-pink">03</span><span class="flex-1 font-bold sm:text-lg">What are the two grades?</span><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blush text-pink transition-all duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-pink group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 pl-[3.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:px-6 sm:pb-6 sm:pl-[4.25rem]">Super High Quality (SHQ) and Super Quality (Super). Ask on WhatsApp which grade fits the price you sell at.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white transition-colors open:border-pink/40 open:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-28px_rgb(233_30_115/0.45)]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="tabular w-6 shrink-0 text-sm font-extrabold text-pink">04</span><span class="flex-1 font-bold sm:text-lg">Can it be dyed and heat styled?</span><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blush text-pink transition-all duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-pink group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 pl-[3.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:px-6 sm:pb-6 sm:pl-[4.25rem]">Yes. For how far each line and color can be lightened, ask sales on WhatsApp before you order.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white transition-colors open:border-pink/40 open:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-28px_rgb(233_30_115/0.45)]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-4